# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /test
- :warning: removed the enum value `alpha` of the request property `mode`
- :warning: removed the enum value `beta` of the request property `mode`
-  request property `mode` list-of-types was widened by adding types `integer` to media type `application/json`




## Info
-  a breaking change was detected but the version is still `1.0.0`




